        "line": 390,
        "text": "theorem tau_coordinate_identity {a : ℝ} (ha : 0 < a) (ha1 : a < 1)\n    {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hp : 0 < p.1) :\n    p.1 = coordinateQ a p * (1 - coordinateEta a p ^ 2)"
